---
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">Москва и область &middot; монтаж за 1 день</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Навесы <span>из поликарбоната</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Бесплатный замер и точная смета за 15 минут.<br />
      Гарантия 10 лет, установка за 1 день.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#callback" class="hero-cta" data-fancybox>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/>
        </svg>
        Вызвать замерщика &mdash; 0 &#8381;
      </a>
      <a href="/cena/" class="hero-ghost">Калькулятор</a>
    </div>

    <ul class="hero-trust">
      <li>Замер &mdash; бесплатно</li>
      <li>Смета за 15 минут</li>
      <li>Гарантия 10 лет</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="hero-cards">
      <a href="/katalog/navesy/" class="hero-card">
        <img src="/uploads/2021/05/navesy-na-dache-iz-polikarbonata.webp" alt="Арочный навес из поликарбоната на даче — реальный объект" loading="eager" />
        <span class="hero-card-bottom"><span class="hero-card-title">Навесы</span><span class="hero-card-more">Смотреть &rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
      <a href="/katalog/zabory/" class="hero-card">
        <img src="/uploads/2021/05/vysokie-zabory-iz-polikarbonata.webp" alt="Высокий забор из поликарбоната — реальный объект" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="hero-card-bottom"><span class="hero-card-title">Заборы</span><span class="hero-card-more">Смотреть &rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
      <a href="/katalog/besedki/" class="hero-card">
        <img src="/uploads/2021/05/besedki-iz-polikarbonata3.webp" alt="Беседка из поликарбоната — реальный объект" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="hero-card-bottom"><span class="hero-card-title">Беседки</span><span class="hero-card-more">Смотреть &rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(12, 14, 18, 0.55) 0%, rgba(12, 14, 18, 0.25) 45%, rgba(12, 14, 18, 0.72) 100%),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(12, 14, 18, 0.82) 0%, rgba(12, 14, 18, 0.45) 55%, rgba(12, 14, 18, 0.15) 100%),
      url('/uploads/2021/05/ulichnye-navesy-iz-polikarbonata.webp') center 65% / cover no-repeat;
    background-color: #14161b;
    padding: 54px 20px 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 1020px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    padding: 7px 14px 7px 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff;
    border-left: 3px solid #f97316;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
  }
  .hero-title {
    margin: 0;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4.6vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .hero-title span {
    color: #fb923c;
  }
  .hero-sub {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
    font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 18px);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 22px;
  }
  .hero-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: #f97316;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 13px 26px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.38);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }
  .hero-cta:hover {
    background: #ea580c;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.45);
  }
  .hero-ghost {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 13px 24px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .hero-ghost:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-color: #fff;
  }
  .hero-trust {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 26px;
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .hero-trust li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 24px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .hero-trust li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 2px;
    width: 15px;
    height: 8px;
    border-left: 2.5px solid #f97316;
    border-bottom: 2.5px solid #f97316;
    transform: rotate(-45deg);
  }
  .hero-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .hero-card {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    height: 140px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
  }
  .hero-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  }
  .hero-card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .hero-card-bottom {
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto 0 0 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 40px 16px 14px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(10, 12, 15, 0.85));
  }
  .hero-card-title {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .hero-card-more {
    color: #fdba74;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero { padding: 44px 16px 0; }
    .hero-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .hero-card { height: 120px; }
    .hero-card:last-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; height: 140px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 460px) {
    .hero { padding: 32px 12px 0; overflow-x: hidden; }
    .hero-inner { width: 100%; max-width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .hero-actions { width: 100%; margin: 16px 0 0 0; padding: 0; justify-content: flex-start; }
    .hero-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-card, .hero-card:last-child { height: 140px; }
    .hero-cta, .hero-ghost { width: 100%; max-width: 100%; margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; justify-content: center; }
  }
</style>
